  "description": "REPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES GRAVEL CARBON with light monocoque UD disc carbon frame, disc brakes, 12mm thru axle is the bike designed for the most demanding gravel routes. The powerful disc brakes, the oversized 700x40 gravel tires and the comfortable geometries offer further traction and stability making it reliable in every situation. Available in the 11-speed Sram Apex setup, or in the two Shimano GRX400 and GRX600 versions with 20 and 22 speeds specific for gravel biking. IDEAL FOR Gravel Carbon is designed for competitions, to tackle even the toughest courses such as those of the UCI World Series. Mixed routes, dirt roads, dirt roads or asphalt, it is designed for long and demanding outings, where it may also be necessary to equip yourself with bags and accessories. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for a versatile, easy to handle and light bike, with extraordinary capabilities which will comfortably take you beyond the usual road route.",
